sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Browser Client
    participant DRF as Django REST API
    participant Signal as Django Signal
    participant Channel as Django Channels<br/>(Redis Layer)
    participant Celery as Celery Worker
    participant Push as Web Push Service

    Note over Client,Channel: Real-time WebSocket connection
    Client->>Channel: WS CONNECT /ws/notifications/
    Channel-->>Client: Connected (user_{id} group)

    Note over DRF,Push: Notification creation flow
    DRF->>DRF: Save Notification object
    DRF->>Signal: post_save signal fires
    Signal->>Channel: async_to_sync → group_send<br/>(notification_update)
    Channel-->>Client: JSON message<br/>{type, notification, unread_count}
    Signal->>Celery: send_push_notification.delay(id)
    Celery->>Push: VAPID-signed POST to endpoint
    Push-->>Client: Browser push notification

    Note over DRF,Celery: Celery Beat periodic tasks
    Celery->>Celery: check_reminders (every 60s)
    Celery->>DRF: Query EventReminder.processed=False
    Celery->>Channel: send_websocket_notification_task
    Celery->>Push: dispatch push per subscription

    Note over Client,Push: Admin broadcast flow
    DRF->>Celery: process_broadcast_job.delay(id)
    Celery->>DRF: Create Notification per recipient
    Celery->>Push: send_push_notification per recipient
    Celery->>Channel: WebSocket update per recipient
